{"text": "Sandel had come from New Zealand with a fine record, and for him, a young man with everything to gain, Tom was only a step upward. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Youth was the Nemesis, Tom thought, for it destroyed the old fighters one by one and, in doing so, slowly destroyed itself as well. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At the hall the secretary asked how he felt, and Tom answered, Fit as a fiddle, though he would have given anything for a piece of steak. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When he climbed into the ring, the crowd cheered, though most of the faces were strange to him, the faces of a younger generation. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then Sandel stepped through the ropes, a young man with a curly mop of yellow hair and muscles that seemed to slide like living things. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> From the first bell Sandel rushed at him with all the fire of youth, but Tom merely covered himself and did not strike back once. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Sandel must first foam away the froth of his youth, Tom knew, and until then the old man had to save every ounce of strength. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He always ended a round in his own corner so that he could sit down at once, while the crowd shouted, Why do you not fight, Tom.", "alignment": {"characters": ["S", "a", "n", "d", "e", "l", " ", "h", "a", "d", " ", "c", "o", "m", "e", " ", "f", "r", "o", "m", " ", "N", "e", "w", " ", "Z", "e", "a", "l", "a", "n", "d", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "a", " ", "f", "i", "n", "e", " ", "r", "e", "c", "o", "r", "d", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "f", "o", "r", " ", "h", "i", "m", ",", " ", "a", " ", "y", "o", "u", "n", "g", " ", "m", "a", "n", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "e", "v", "e", "r", "y", "t", "h", "i", "n", "g", " ", "t", "o", " ", "g", "a", "i", "n", ",", " ", "T", "o", "m", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "o", "n", "l", "y", " ", "a", " ", "s", "t", "e", "p", " ", "u", "p", "w", "a", "r", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s